  {
   "id": "CsvJEnqb7fsJ",
   "from": "DataScientist",
   "author": "e9306eecf91f7405",
   "date": "2012-03-23T15:11:57Z",
   "subject": "Re: 請教R寫法: 在data中找出小於3個missing的列，並填上mean值",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">也可考慮用下列for迴圈，判讀各列NAs個數，並以平均數取代第一及第四列的NAs。</span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">a </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>c(<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#c38909\">NA</span>,<span style=\"color:#c38909\">NA</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">b </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>c(<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">c </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>c(rep(<span style=\"color:#c38909\">NA</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">6</span>),<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">d </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>c(<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#c38909\">NA</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">e </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>c(<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">f </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>c(<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">tmp </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>rbind(<span style=\"color:#000000\">a</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">b</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">c</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">d</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">e</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">f</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\">colnames(<span style=\"color:#000000\">tmp</span>)<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>paste(<span style=\"color:#b01300\">&#39;U&#39;</span>,<span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>:<span style=\"color:#055217\">8</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">sep</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01300\">&#39;.&#39;</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;min-height:15.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">tmp</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;min-height:15.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#c38909\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#c38909\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#055217\">1</span>:nrow(<span style=\"color:#000000\">tmp</span>))<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>{</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span><span style=\"color:#c38909\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>((sum(<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239017576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ySYUmvVMIJwpTwZq4a_Qe\">is.na</a>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">tmp</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>,]))<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>&lt;=<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#055217\">3</span>)<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>&amp;&amp;<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>(sum(<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239017576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ySYUmvVMIJwpTwZq4a_Qe\">is.na</a>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">tmp</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>,]))<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>!=<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#055217\">0</span>))<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>{</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>tmp</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>,<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239017576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ySYUmvVMIJwpTwZq4a_Qe\">is.na</a>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">tmp</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>,])]<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>mean(<span style=\"color:#000000\">tmp</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>,],<span style=\"color:#000000\"> na.rm</span>=<span style=\"color:#c38909\">TRUE</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#171499\">}</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#171499\">}</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;min-height:15.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">tmp<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;min-height:15.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></p><br>Karine Koh於 2012年3月23日星期五UTC+8下午10時12分07秒寫道："
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br><br>On Friday, March 23, 2012 8:53:53 PM UTC+8, Jerry wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">您好：<p>我以第一列為說明，首先我將第一列放入kk變數中<br>kk&lt;-c(0,0,1,1,NA,NA,1,2)</p><p>接著下這個指令<br>kk[which(<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239017576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ySYUmvVMIJwpTwZq4a_Qe\">is.na</a>(kk))]&lt;-round(​​mean(kk,na.rm=T),1)<br>[以下恕刪] <br></p></blockquote><div> 太感謝你了!!</div><div>我再試試看 :)</div></blockquote>"
