    [
     1,
     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>還有其它解套的方法，R的優點就是有彈性！謝謝妳的寶貴分享！</div><div><br></div><div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">a &lt;- c(<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#9f0097\">NA</span>,<span style=\"color:#9f0097\">NA</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">b &lt;- c(<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">c &lt;- c(rep(<span style=\"color:#9f0097\">NA</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">6</span>),<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">d &lt;- c(<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#9f0097\">NA</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">e &lt;- c(<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">f &lt;- c(<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>)</p>\r\n</div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#37955d\"># tmp &lt;- rbind(a,b,c,d,e,f)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">tmp &lt;- as.data.frame(rbind(a,b,c,d,e,f))</p></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">colnames(tmp) &lt;- paste(<span style=\"color:#5947c4\">&#39;U&#39;</span>,<span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span><span style=\"color:#bb4595\">:</span><span style=\"color:#1d0098\">8</span>,sep=<span style=\"color:#5947c4\">&#39;.&#39;</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;min-height:15.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">tmp</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;min-height:15.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#9e0076\">for</span> (i <span style=\"color:#9e0076\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#1d0098\">1</span><span style=\"color:#bb4595\">:</span>nrow(tmp)) {</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#9e0076\">if</span> ((sum(<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239017579000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ejZ5cAt61Qk9EQ4TSBNHI\">is.na</a>(tmp<span style=\"color:#487373\">[</span>i,<span style=\"color:#487373\">]</span>)) <span style=\"color:#bb4595\">&lt;=</span> <span style=\"color:#1d0098\">3</span>) <span style=\"color:#bb4595\">&amp;&amp;</span> (sum(<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239017579000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ejZ5cAt61Qk9EQ4TSBNHI\">is.na</a>(tmp<span style=\"color:#487373\">[</span>i,<span style=\"color:#487373\">]</span>)) <span style=\"color:#bb4595\">!=</span> <span style=\"color:#1d0098\">0</span>)) {</p>\r\n</div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span> tmp<span style=\"color:#487373\">[</span>i,<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239017579000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ejZ5cAt61Qk9EQ4TSBNHI\">is.na</a>(tmp<span style=\"color:#487373\">[</span>i,<span style=\"color:#487373\">]</span>)<span style=\"color:#487373\">]</span> &lt;- mean(as.matrix(tmp)<span style=\"color:#487373\">[</span>i,<span style=\"color:#487373\">]</span>, na.rm=<span style=\"color:#9f0097\">TRUE</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#37955d\">  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span> #tmp[i,<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239017579000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ejZ5cAt61Qk9EQ4TSBNHI\">is.na</a>(tmp[i,])] &lt;- colMeans(t(tmp), na.rm=TRUE)[i]</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;min-height:15.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>}</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">}</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;min-height:15.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">tmp</p></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><br>On Monday, March 26, 2012 6:47:34 PM UTC+8, Karine Koh wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Hi Jerry &amp; Data Scientist<p>非常謝謝你們給我的建議，幫了我大忙! :)<br>經過測試，有些發現也跟大家分享~<br>由於我的資料是data.frame格式，所以一開始都會出現錯誤訊息：<br>mean(&lt;data.frame&gt;) is deprecated. Use colMeans() or sapply(*, mean)</p><p>後來把mean(tmp[i,], na.rm=TRUE)改成apply(tmp[i,], 1, mean, na.rm=TRUE)，結果就正確<br>了</p><p>不過...好像是如果我一開始有給attach(tmp)就可以執行mean了...是吧 @@<br>我果然是新手阿...</p><p></p><p></p></blockquote></div>"
